  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recovery, Reintegration and Sustainable Livelihoods Programme for Southern Sudan.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a five year programme of which 3 years has been approved to be implemented towards achieving of the outcomes as stipulated in CAFOD Sudan 3 year programme matrix in the Country strategic paper linked to Programme Framework - SUD-10-01. This component of the programme to be implemented by CAFOD country office on behalf of the partners (Sudan aid Juba, Peace and Development office of the Catholic diocese of Tambura/Yambio and Catholic Development Office of Kosti pastoral region) aims at enhancing technical support and coordination of specific capacity building activities as well as support initiatives from within the regional &amp; headquarter offices and with third partner service providers. This specific aspect of the programme also aims at ensuring promotion of inter partner learning and experience sharing opportunities for effective delivery of the programme to benefit approximately 7,970 households living in 11 Counties located in the states of Upper Nile, Central Equatoria and Western Equatoria. The programme shall target both returnees and host communities with special focus on the vulnerable women and people living with HIV&amp; AIDS.</narrative>
  </description>
